---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const baseUrl = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---

<Layout title="50° Compleanno Palladiano | 29 Dicembre 2026">
  <main class="container">
    <!-- HERO SECTION -->
    <header class="hero">
      <div class="badge">SAVE THE DATE • 50 ANNI</div>
      <h1 class="hero-title">Il Cinquantesimo <br/><span class="gold-text">Palladiano</span></h1>
      <p class="hero-subtitle">
        Mezzo secolo di avventure, codice, bicicletta, cappelletti e... scelte gastronomiche discutibili.
      </p>
      
      <div class="event-meta">
        <div class="meta-item">
          <span class="meta-icon">📅</span>
          <div>
            <strong>Martedì 29 Dicembre 2026</strong>
            <small>Dalle ore 12:30 a oltranza</small>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="meta-item">
          <span class="meta-icon">📍</span>
          <div>
            <strong>Zurigo & Bassa Padana</strong>
            <small>Location esatta in arrivo</small>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- COUNTDOWN -->
      <div class="countdown-wrapper">
        <div class="countdown-box">
          <span id="days" class="countdown-val">--</span>
          <span class="countdown-lbl">Giorni</span>
        </div>
        <div class="countdown-box">
          <span id="hours" class="countdown-val">--</span>
          <span class="countdown-lbl">Ore</span>
        </div>
        <div class="countdown-box">
          <span id="minutes" class="countdown-val">--</span>
          <span class="countdown-lbl">Minuti</span>
        </div>
        <div class="countdown-box">
          <span id="seconds" class="countdown-val">--</span>
          <span class="countdown-lbl">Secondi</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-cta">
        <a href="#menu" class="btn btn-primary">Scopri il Menu Esclusivo 🍽️</a>
        <a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSe7pxMlIpxkDulRh-8460JMo3VTDrOgrDahOHObCmnFk-o_Eg/viewform" target="_blank" class="btn btn-secondary">Conferma Presenza (RSVP) ✍️</a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- HIGHLIGHT SECTION: LA VEGANIGA -->
    <section id="menu" class="section">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="tag-green">🌱 ESCLUSIVA GASTRONOMICA CRUELTY-FREE</span>
        <h2>Il Menu Ufficiale: Il Trionfo della Veganiga</h2>
        <p class="section-desc">
          Per celebrare questo traguardo epocale, la cucina ha elaborato un banchetto a impatto karmico zero. Nessun animale è stato guardato con disappunto durante la preparazione.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="dish-showcase">
        <div class="dish-img-card">
          <img src={`${baseUrl}/images/bigoli_con_veganiga.png`} alt="Bigoli con la Veganiga" class="dish-img" />
          <div class="dish-badge">Piatto d'Onore D.O.P. Fittizio</div>
        </div>

        <div class="dish-details">
          <h3 class="dish-title">Bigoli Fatti a Mano con la Vera Veganiga di Lugano</h3>
          <p class="dish-story">
            La <strong>Veganiga</strong> è la leggendaria salsiccia vegetale verde smeraldo, insaccata rigorosamente a mano sulle rive del Ceresio. Un capolavoro di bio-ingegneria svizzera che sfida ogni legge della norcineria tradizionale romagnola.
          </p>

          <div class="ingredients-list">
            <h4>🌿 Ingredienti Certificati 100% Ecosostenibili:</h4>
            <ul>
              <li>🥦 <strong>Cimette di Broccolo & Cavolfiore Alpino:</strong> Raccolti all'alba mentre dormivano.</li>
              <li>🥒 <strong>Cetrioli Fermentati a Freddo:</strong> Per un retrogusto croccante e rinfrescante.</li>
              <li>🫚 <strong>Radice di Zenzero Bio-Dinamico:</strong> Quel tocco piccante che fa dimenticare la carne.</li>
              <li>💨 <strong>Aria Pura del Monte Brè:</strong> Sigillata direttamente nel budello di cellulosa vegetale.</li>
              <li>🧀 <strong>Formaggio Vegetale di Erba Sintetica:</strong> Grattugiato fresco a pioggia.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="quote-box">
            <em>"Sembra una luganiga, sa di orto sinergico, ma se chiudi gli occhi e bevi tre calici di Sangiovese sembra quasi un miracolo!"</em>
            <div class="quote-author">— Ermete Bottazzi, Camionista & Critico Gastronomico 🚛</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- ALTRE PORTATE DEL MENU -->
      <div class="menu-grid">
        <div class="menu-card">
          <span class="menu-icon">🥣</span>
          <h3>Antipasto Etereo</h3>
          <h4>Aria di Bosco Ticinese emulsionata</h4>
          <p>Servita su crostone di polenta trasparente a impatto calorico negativo e micro-germogli quantistici.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="menu-card featured">
          <span class="menu-icon">🍝</span>
          <h3>Primo Piatto</h3>
          <h4>Bigoli con la Veganiga</h4>
          <p>Il piatto cardine della festa. Bigoli al torchio con ragù di verdure croccanti e zenzero ticinese.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="menu-card">
          <span class="menu-icon">🥬</span>
          <h3>Secondo Filosofico</h3>
          <h4>Stracotto di Tofu Rigenerato</h4>
          <p>Tofu cresciuto ascoltando Vivaldi, stufato in riduzione di tisana al finocchietto e semi di chia.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="menu-card">
          <span class="menu-icon">🎂</span>
          <h3>Dessert Cinquantenario</h3>
          <h4>Torta Palladiana al Vapore di Soia</h4>
          <p>Soffice pan di carota bio con glassa di rugiada mattutina e 50 candeline a ricarica solare.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- PROGRAMMA / COSA SI FA -->
    <section class="section alt-bg">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="tag-gold">⏰ IL PROGRAMMA</span>
        <h2>Cosa si fa il 29 Dicembre?</h2>
        <p class="section-desc">Un fitto calendario di attività per celebrare mezzo secolo di vita.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="timeline">
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <div class="time">12:30</div>
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <h3>Accoglienza & Aperitivo di Decompressione</h3>
            <p>Arrivo degli ospiti, abbracci, controllo del tasso alcolemico e prime battute sul tempo di Zurigo.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <div class="time">13:30</div>
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <h3>Il Grande Banchetto della Veganiga</h3>
            <p>Servizio ufficiale dei Bigoli. Momento solenne di assaggio e dibattito filosofico sui broccoli.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <div class="time">15:30</div>
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <h3>Contro-Brindisi Alcolico di Compensazione</h3>
            <p>Apertura delle bottiglie serie (Sangiovese, Amarone, bollicine) per riequilibrare il karma.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <div class="time">17:00</div>
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <h3>Canti, Rock Anni '80 & Canzoni di Ermete</h3>
            <p>Dalla hit delle Spade Laser e Dinosauri di Ale al concerto epico di mezzanotte.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- RSVP SECTION -->
    <section id="rsvp" class="section">
      <div class="rsvp-card">
        <h2>Sei dei Nostri? ✍️</h2>
        <p>Compila il modulo ufficiale di conferma presenza per permettere allo chef di raccogliere la giusta quantità di cavolfiori a Lugano.</p>
        
        <div style="margin-top: 2rem;">
          <a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSe7pxMlIpxkDulRh-8460JMo3VTDrOgrDahOHObCmnFk-o_Eg/viewform" target="_blank" class="btn btn-primary btn-block" style="display: block; text-align: center; font-size: 1.15rem; padding: 1.1rem;">
            Apri il Modulo Ufficiale Google Form 📝✨
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FOOTER -->
    <footer class="footer">
      <p>50° Compleanno Palladiano • 29 Dicembre 2026 • Zurigo</p>
      <small>Confezionato con ❤️ e Astro da Ermete Bottazzi 🚛 • <a href="https://github.com/palladius/compleanno-palladiano-2026" target="_blank">GitHub Repo</a></small>
    </footer>
  </main>

  <script>
    // Live Countdown
    const targetDate = new Date("2026-12-29T12:30:00+01:00").getTime();

    function updateCountdown() {
      const now = new Date().getTime();
      const distance = targetDate - now;

      if (distance < 0) {
        document.getElementById("days").innerText = "0";
        document.getElementById("hours").innerText = "0";
        document.getElementById("minutes").innerText = "0";
        document.getElementById("seconds").innerText = "0";
        return;
      }

      const days = Math.floor(distance / (1000 * 60 * 60 * 24));
      const hours = Math.floor((distance % (1000 * 60 * 60 * 24)) / (1000 * 60 * 60));
      const minutes = Math.floor((distance % (1000 * 60 * 60)) / (1000 * 60));
      const seconds = Math.floor((distance % (1000 * 60)) / 1000);

      document.getElementById("days").innerText = days;
      document.getElementById("hours").innerText = hours;
      document.getElementById("minutes").innerText = minutes;
      document.getElementById("seconds").innerText = seconds;
    }

    updateCountdown();
    setInterval(updateCountdown, 1000);
  </script>
</Layout>

<style>
  .container {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
  }

  .hero {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 4rem 1rem 3rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
  }

  .badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.4rem 1.2rem;
    background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.15);
    color: var(--accent-gold);
    border: 1px solid var(--accent-gold);
    border-radius: 9999px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-size: 3.5rem;
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
  }

  .gold-text {
    color: var(--accent-gold);
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fbbf24, #d97706);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  }

  .hero-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    max-width: 650px;
    margin: 0 auto 2.5rem;
  }

  .event-meta {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .meta-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    padding: 0.8rem 1.4rem;
    border-radius: 12px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    text-align: left;
  }

  .meta-icon {
    font-size: 1.8rem;
  }

  .meta-item strong {
    display: block;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .meta-item small {
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  /* COUNTDOWN */
  .countdown-wrapper {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin: 2rem 0 2.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .countdown-box {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.3);
    padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 16px;
    min-width: 90px;
    text-align: center;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
  }

  .countdown-val {
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--accent-gold);
    display: block;
    line-height: 1;
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
  }

  .countdown-lbl {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-top: 0.4rem;
    display: block;
  }

  .hero-cta {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .btn {
    padding: 0.9rem 1.8rem;
    border-radius: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 1rem;
    border: none;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    background: var(--accent-gold);
    color: #0f172a;
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    background: #d97706;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .btn-secondary {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    color: var(--text-light);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
  }

  .btn-secondary:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .btn-block {
    width: 100%;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  /* SECTIONS */
  .section {
    padding: 5rem 0;
  }

  .section-header {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto 3.5rem;
  }

  .tag-green {
    color: var(--accent-green);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .tag-gold {
    color: var(--accent-gold);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .section-header h2 {
    font-size: 2.4rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .section-desc {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  /* DISH SHOWCASE */
  .dish-showcase {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.2fr;
    gap: 3rem;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border-radius: 24px;
    padding: 2.5rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  @media (max-width: 850px) {
    .dish-showcase {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  .dish-img-card {
    position: relative;
    border-radius: 16px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .dish-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    border-radius: 16px;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
  }

  .dish-img:hover {
    transform: scale(1.03);
  }

  .dish-badge {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 12px;
    left: 12px;
    background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.85);
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    color: var(--accent-green);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    padding: 0.4rem 0.8rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.4);
  }

  .dish-title {
    font-size: 2rem;
    color: var(--accent-gold);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .dish-story {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--text-light);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .ingredients-list h4 {
    color: var(--accent-green);
    margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .ingredients-list ul {
    list-style: none;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .ingredients-list li {
    padding: 0.3rem 0;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .quote-box {
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-gold);
    padding: 1rem;
    border-radius: 0 12px 12px 0;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .quote-author {
    font-style: normal;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--accent-gold);
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  /* MENU GRID */
  .menu-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .menu-card {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    padding: 1.8rem;
    border-radius: 16px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .menu-card.featured {
    border-color: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.4);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.05) 0%, var(--bg-card) 100%);
  }

  .menu-icon {
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .menu-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--accent-gold);
    margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
  }

  .menu-card h4 {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
  }

  .menu-card p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  /* TIMELINE */
  .timeline {
    max-width: 650px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    position: relative;
    border-left: 2px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.3);
    padding-left: 2rem;
  }

  .timeline-item {
    position: relative;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .timeline-item::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: -2.45rem;
    top: 0.2rem;
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--accent-gold);
    box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--accent-gold);
  }

  .timeline-item .time {
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--accent-gold);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
  }

  .timeline-content h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }

  .timeline-content p {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  /* RSVP CARD */
  .rsvp-card {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e293b 0%, #0f172a 100%);
    border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.3);
    border-radius: 24px;
    padding: 3rem 2rem;
    max-width: 550px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
  }

  .rsvp-card h2 {
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--accent-gold);
  }

  .rsvp-card p {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .rsvp-form {
    text-align: left;
  }

  .form-group {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .form-group label {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .form-group input, .form-group select {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 0.8rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 10px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    color: var(--text-light);
    font-size: 1rem;
    outline: none;
  }

  .form-group input:focus, .form-group select:focus {
    border-color: var(--accent-gold);
  }

  /* FOOTER */
  .footer {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 3rem 0 1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .footer a {
    color: var(--accent-gold);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
</style>
